# Findings the image scan in .github/workflows/cd.yml may skip. Trivy reads
# this file from the checkout root. Every entry says why, and the expiring
# entry fails the scan again after its date, so it cannot be forgotten.
#
# ci-cd-github-actions ticket 15 upgraded next from 14.2.35 to 16.3.6, which
# fixes both advisories that used to be muted here (GHSA-p293-qw3h-jr36 /
# CVE-2026-75604, and the sharp/libheif AVIF RCE GHSA-2xp9-vwfh-vxw4 that used
# to be muted only because next.config.mjs's images.unoptimized closed the
# path — see src/__tests__/next-config-images.test.ts). Trivy flags both by
# package version, so upgrading past the fixed release stops it reporting
# them; nothing needs muting for either right now.
